  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IIED Core Support 2025-2029</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core support to International Institute for Environment and Development for the period 2025-2029. The Danish support will contribute towards the following overall impacts of IIED: 1) Shifted trade, finance, investments, 2) Transformed climate action and governance, 3) Advanced sustainable and equitable forest, farm, and fisheries, 4) Empowered displaced people and migrants build secure and prosperous futures, 6) Evolve cities as places of inspiration and justice.</narrative>
  </description>
